#: d68b7c3786fd46dfb980cd2a4edb07db
msgid ""
"ros2 param list\n"
"ros2 param list /ocs2_arm_controller\n"
"ros2 param get /ocs2_arm_controller movel_duration\n"
"ros2 param get /left_gripper_controller force_threshold"
msgstr ""
"ros2 param list\n"
"ros2 param list /ocs2_arm_controller\n"
"ros2 param get /ocs2_arm_controller movel_duration\n"
"ros2 param get /left_gripper_controller force_threshold"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/12-ros2_parameters.md:31
#: 3187acedec4b42f3bc49998cb5203619
msgid ""
"Hardware `<param>` values do **not** appear on `ros2 param list`. They "
"are baked into `/robot_description` when xacro runs. Confirm the plugin "
"with `ros2 control list_hardware_interfaces` and the xacro under "
"`xacro/ros2_control/`."
msgstr ""
"硬件 `<param>` **不会**出现在 `ros2 param list` 上。它们在 xacro 运行时写入 "
"`/robot_description`。用 `ros2 control list_hardware_interfaces` 以及 "
"`xacro/ros2_control/` 下的 xacro 确认插件。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/12-ros2_parameters.md:33
#: eb84ab2bff6d41e0b8ed88ec17b8633c
msgid "Startup vs runtime (what is verified)"
msgstr "启动时 vs 运行时（已核实内容）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/12-ros2_parameters.md:35
#: e591561cc3e548f0882d44441860f9a7
msgid ""
"A value in YAML is always applied when the controller or hardware plugin "
"**starts**. Whether `ros2 param set` later changes behavior is recorded "
"only when a source or README says so:"
msgstr ""
"YAML 中的值在控制器或硬件插件**启动**时总会生效。之后 `ros2 param set` 会不会改行为，只在源码或 README "
"写明时才记录："

